{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, she has been considering returning to be closer to her grandmother and extended family","evidence":"[D19:1 | 9:55 am on 22 October, 2023] Caroline: Woohoo Melanie! I passed the adoption agency interviews last Friday! I'm so excited and thankful. This is a big move towards my goal of having a family.\n[D19:3 | 9:55 am on 22 October, 2023] Caroline: Thanks so much, Melanie! It's beautiful! It really brings home how much love's in families - both blood and the ones we choose. I hope to build my own family and put a roof over kids who haven't had that before. For me, adoption is a way of giving back and showing love and acceptance.","itemId":"urn:uuid:16bb6fc7-f608-5cc1-bc34-606db0b99510","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2d1bd9f77b9545de44c6ca3091439badc62e431e69cfd567c0e716b9ab4e3770","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline want to move back to her home country soon?","referenceAnswer":"No; she's in the process of adopting children.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2d1bd9f77b9545de44c6ca3091439badc62e431e69cfd567c0e716b9ab4e3770"}}]}